OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin cloudy
OL,6,Fwith patchy light rain. This will soon
OL,7,Fclear as bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fincrease during the morning. The
OL,9,Fafternoon will continue dry with sunny
OL,10,Fperiods in the north east.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe evening will be dry with
OL,13,Fsunny spells. The night will continue
OL,14,Fdry with clear periods becoming cloudy
OL,15,Fat times later.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FAfter a dry and bright start
OL,18,Fto the morning cloud will spread
OL,19,Fsoutheast from the afternoon with rain
OL,20,Ffollowing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
